/T (1. Presentation Format       Ensure the presentation is prepared using suitable software \(e.g. PowerPoint,                                        Google Slides, Canva\). 2. Device Readiness       Each team is responsible for bringing their own device for the session. Make sure         the device is fully charged, HDMI-compatible, and the presentation is ready for        smooth display. 3. Preparation Time       Each team will be given 5 minutes to prepare before their turn. A member of the          secretariat will escort the team outside the hall for final preparations and        discussion. 4. Presenter       A maximum of two \(2\) presenters are allowed to present or pitch on behalf of the          team. 5. Pitch Duration       Each team is allocated a maximum of 5 minutes to deliver their pitch. 6. Pitch Timing)
/E (1. Presentation Format       Ensure the presentation is prepared using suitable software \(e.g. PowerPoint,                                        Google Slides, Canva\). 2. Device Readiness       Each team is responsible for bringing their own device for the session. Make sure         the device is fully charged, HDMI-compatible, and the presentation is ready for        smooth display. 3. Preparation Time       Each team will be given 5 minutes to prepare before their turn. A member of the          secretariat will escort the team outside the hall for final preparations and        discussion. 4. Presenter       A maximum of two \(2\) presenters are allowed to present or pitch on behalf of the          team. 5. Pitch Duration       Each team is allocated a maximum of 5 minutes to deliver their pitch. 6. Pitch Timing)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [4]
>>
